		{
			title: "Collect Em All!"
			x: -0.75d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "MOD : Buddycards"
			description: [
				"&3Aha! Is that... a pack of Buddycards?! Yess, I've been looking for someone to play for months!"
				""
				"&3Come on come on, what'd you get? What... oh. OH RIGHT, you are Bandit yes? Sorry sorry, got ahead of myself didn't I!"
				""
				"&3My name is Collector Charlie. Collecting isn't my Research role but, uh, I've become known as Collector Charlie, since I collect a lot of things. Comics, cards, board games, you name it!"
				""
				"&3I've been keeping my eye on the Buddycard system for a while. It's fully digital, but that gives it a unique twist on what it can do!"
				""
				"&3Like, did you know, when you collect a full set, you get a Curios that will give you a boost? Yep, a medal as a reward, that could make you move faster! Crazy mechanic, right?"
				""
				"&3Oh hey, here! A manual!"
			]
