				"&3So this is the Base set, Bandit. Packs are usually in dungeon loot in the Overworld. And occasionally in other worlds too! As well, Zombie Villagers and Baby Zombies may have a pack in their pockets."
				""
				"&3The set has 27 cards. 12 Common, 9 Uncommon, 4 Rare, and 2 Epic rarity."
