			description: [
				"&3Now, most every pack (except the special Mystery Packs!) contain 4 cards from one of the FIVE current sets available."
				""
				"&3One of the cards will randomly be a Shiny card. These are rarer to find, and even rarer to collect an entire set of them! But hey that's the dream!"
