		{
			title: "Digital Addiction"
			x: -0.25d
			y: 0.875d
			shape: "gear"
			description: [
				"&7Hmm, relying on the FOP's ridiculous way they bait and monetize the players with this card game is quite annoying."
				""
				"&3Right? They offer one booster box for sale (that's way overpriced, geez!), and the other ways to find them require you to gear up, buy into their ecosystem, and more silly things!"
				""
				"&7Hmm, let's fix that. At least for Bandit. "
				""
				"&dIf you are talking about selling the packs ourselves, Squeaker, we'll need to run some cleaning spellcode on em. That's one of the FOP's biggest resource sinks, and they protect it heavily."
				""
				"&7Right, ma'am. Bandit, the clean card packs will be in the shop. Well, three of them. Two of the packs take special crafting to make."
				""
				"&3Oh yeah, I'll cover those. Thanks, bosses!"
			]
			dependencies: ["59D8ACD3139E019B"]
			size: 0.5d
			id: "20936140548A7A6B"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5CEE101C5779919B"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "The Shine Like Diamond"
			x: 1.25d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&3Bandit, the reason that Buddycards are powerful (and trust me, they are, just wait!), is because the cards are crafted with a rare material called Luminus."
				""
				"&3This magical stuff is somewhere between Crystal and Metal. And it has a very specific glow and shine to it when its pressed into wafer thin cards and printed upon just right. It's what gives Buddycards such a catching allure."
				""
				"&3So Luminus is one of those tiny, trace materials you hear about when scientists are figuring out what a planet is made of. The FOP, when they digitize a planet, they siphon all that little tiny amounts into their Overworld. And it pools and forms Luminus Ore."
				""
				"&3And then Users and Power Users like yourself go near bedrock and dig it up for them. And smelt it in a Furnace for them. And then make Equipment and new Buddycards for them, waiting for them become a Shiny, powerful card."
			]
			dependencies: ["54AEE29A46710545"]
			id: "64ED9A476D5E75EE"
			tasks: [{
				id: "367D4F1713983B9E"
				type: "item"
				item: "buddycards:luminis"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "2F46C669114DF486"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Bright Panels"
			x: 1.25d
			y: -2.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: ["&3Luminus is a really pretty material on its own. You can store it as a Storage Block, like any other Metal or Crystal or Gem. But you can also break it down into Panels, and turn those panels into a few nice looking building materials."]
			dependencies: ["64ED9A476D5E75EE"]
			id: "37BFFC79E7D31977"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "13EA357B3AFF38CC"
					type: "item"
					item: "buddycards:luminis_panel"
