		{
			title: "The Kids You Meet"
			x: 7.0d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&3Card tournaments, card meets, heck even the card stores draw all kindsa weird people. I ain't afraid to admit I'm one of them. A top researcher whose super invested into collecting pieces of inked cardboard, and even weirder... pixel versions of inked cardboard?"
				""
				"&3Well anyways! Some of the strangest, but nicest ones you'll meet are the quiet, respectful kids. Like these Enderlings. You can find em wandering around close to their parents."
				""
				"&3Bring your collection! These Enderlings are up for trading, but are after specific cards. And they trade you in something called Zylex."
				""
				"&3Zylex's a powerful Enderman material, according to my research. Eh, what's my research? Later, later!"
				""
				"&3But hey, having trouble finding an Enderling? I put up some Trade Beacons in the Shop for ya, puts out a call for one ready to trade!"
			]
			dependencies: ["64ED9A476D5E75EE"]
			id: "46BED1A82AE963DD"
			tasks: [{
				id: "281C443A81039F32"
				type: "item"
				item: "buddycards:zylex"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "456347A9DBAFF04E"
