				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Strength of the Cards"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&3See, I mentioned that the Buddycards are made with Luminis yeah? Well, if you take some cards, even if they are Shredded, you can mix them with some Lapis Lazuli Blocks and Blocks of Iron to get what we call a Buddysteel Blend. "
				""
				"&3Don't ask how the solid Iron becomes a powdery blend... that's all the fault of Luminis material. But throw that into a Furnace with a lot of Coal, or even better a Blast Furnace."
			]
			dependencies: ["64ED9A476D5E75EE"]
			id: "37922460FDB0D05A"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "0C3359F9559C55E2"
