		{
			title: "Hook n Slice"
			x: 4.75d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&3Now, the Buddysteel tools are quite useful, but you can make some odd choices of tools to make. Or... is it really that odd?"
				""
				"&3I mean, take the Buddysteel Fishing Rod, Hook and Filet Knife. They all get stronger as you collect more sets! You don't collect more fish or get more filets out of em, but they end up sharper and better anyways!"
				""
				"&3The Hook you can apply to an Aquaculture fishing rod like any other fishing rod: With a Tacklebox, of course."
			]
			dependencies: [
				"37922460FDB0D05A"
				"22346B225DCA15FC"
