		{
			title: "Buddysteel Gear"
			x: 4.0d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&3Now, for the really interesting part, Bandit. This Buddysteel? It's like simple Iron tools, or Chainmail armor."
				""
				"&3To start with, that is."
				""
				"&3See, the power of Luminis is tied to how much of it you have collected. And not just any Luminis, but the power that is activated in the form of Buddycards."
				""
				"&3The more cards you have, every complete set you own, powers up Buddysteel Tools and Armor more and more."
				""
				"&3By the time you collect all of them, your Armor and Gear will be more powerful than even Netherite. Amazing, huh?!"
			]
			dependencies: ["37922460FDB0D05A"]
			id: "22346B225DCA15FC"
			tasks: [
