		{
			title: "The Buddycard Binder"
			x: -7.25d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&3Now, keeping stacks of cards in your inventory is all well and good if you are just starting out... but there's over 100 cards, yeah? Make yourself a Buddycard Binder!"
				""
				"&3Each slot in a Buddycard Binder can hold a full stack of a specific card. And if you run out of pages, take it over to your Enchanting Table and slap on an Extra Page enchantment!"
				""
				"&3Oh! Also, you make the Buddycard Binder by crafting it with 3 cards from the same set. That set determines what your Buddycard Binder looks like!"
			]
			dependencies: ["54AEE29A46710545"]
			id: "7FC84AA65B4C2F50"
