		{
			title: "A Little Bit of Everything"
			x: -2.25d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "diamond"
			description: [
				"&3If you got some spare packs and extra resources, you can craft yourself some Mystery Packs. "
				""
				"&3Though a mite expensive, these packs NINE cards instead of 4, and two of them will be shiny. They also can contain a card from ANY set, making these excellent when you are trying to complete the harder to find sets."
