			x: -5.25d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&3If you got a lot of packs you are saving up to do a big opening party (those are always fun!), you can store and show them off in a neat way by making a Booster Display Box."
				""
				"&3Just craft 6 of the same set to make it into a Booster Display Box."
				""
				"&3Even better? You can stack up to THREE of these display boxes into the same spot! An actual DISPLAY! It looks quite fantastic, at least to me."
