			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&3Got one really good card you want to show off all on its own? Then you want to use a Card Stand! It lets you show it off in all its glory, at an angle you want."
				""
				"&3But you'll probably also want to protect your Displays and Stands by locking them, especially if you got a lot of assistants wandering around! Using the Buddysteel Key will lock Displays and Stands to you and only you."
