		{
			title: "Getting the Grade"
			x: -6.0d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&3True Buddycard collectors look to get their cards Graded on quality and perfection."
				""
				"&3How do you grade a digital game card? Well... keep in mind regular Users think its just A Game, but you Power User know its a digitized piece of reality. So certain... rules and realities are still in place."
				""
				"&3So, for Buddycards... grading is measuring how much 'perfect' Luminis is in a card. The higher, the better the grade."
				""
				"&3You can make Grading Sleeves to check what grade your card is. Put the Grading Sleeve in your Off Hand, and Right Click with the card you want to grade."
				""
				"&3Grades range from D (kinda junk) to S (perfection). Lots of traders will be looking for minimum or specific grades."
			]
			dependencies: ["7FC84AA65B4C2F50"]
